{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/extras/82867885be61a268c054ac22b808d2c3.poster.avif?t=1756224794\" width=600 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/extras/82867885be61a268c054ac22b808d2c3.webm?t=1756224794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adorable cube-shaped cat finds itself blocked by cheese. Lots of cheese. Your mission? Push, strategize, and clear the path to the big red button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/extras/bee70cd872d309f34aa993e7660b37c5.poster.avif?t=1756224794\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/extras/bee70cd872d309f34aa993e7660b37c5.webm?t=1756224794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each cheesy level completed you get one step further to solving the mystery of the cheese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/extras/2bcea1d2648989efce8c3a20c71037a7.avif?t=1756224794\" width=600 height=110 /></span>Immerse yourself in an adorable and cozy world filled with cheese. Meet some old friends along the way giving you clues of the origin of the mystery cheese.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Award-Winning Puzzle Fun!</strong> \ud83c\udfc6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83e\udd47 Winner: <i>Best Game Idea</i> \u2013 The Great Winter Pitch 2023</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83e\udd48 Runner-Up: <i>The Great Summer Pitch 2023</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/extras/12a81c183b6d479be261094bbfe116ae.avif?t=1756224794\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore beautiful islands filled with over 100 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Master each puzzles and unlock new worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategize your moves and aim for the least rolls possible to be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy atmospheric worlds with mind bending challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect coins and tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cosy and relaxing atmosphere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2341100?t=1756224794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/0effa3d7d50727ddd6658551876623adcc28b865/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756224794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/d463019b4d6c626e00ab2b6ba684a22597c4b60f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756224794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/d463019b4d6c626e00ab2b6ba684a22597c4b60f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756224794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2357710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2341100/extras/82867885be61a268c054ac22